message: "If you reference these guides, please credit the author and identify the version used."
title: "LG Monitor Companion-Software Mitigation Guides for Windows 11 Home and Pro"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Amyashi"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Amyashi/lg-monitor-companion-software-mitigation"
url: "https://github.com/Amyashi/lg-monitor-companion-software-mitigation"
abstract: >-
  Independently authored, edition-specific Windows 11 Home and Pro runbooks
  for identifying, removing, verifying, and, when justified, mitigating the
  recurrence of LG monitor companion software. The exact tested Microsoft
  Store package is LGElectronics.LGMonitorApp; other package identities and
  delivery paths require separate confirmation.
keywords:
  - "Windows 11 Home"
  - "Windows 11 Pro"
  - "LG monitor"
  - "AppLocker"
  - "Microsoft Defender"
  - "least privilege"
  - "companion software"
  - "package removal"
